<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - America West said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - America West said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded America West Airlines Inc to market perform from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Thursday at 14.</p>
